+
+Complete before implementation; use [TASK_LIFECYCLE.md](TASK_LIFECYCLE.md). This unfilled template is BLOCKED and grants no authorization. R0 tasks may record these fields briefly inline.
+
+- Latest request/decision and referenced evidence; previous step acceptance:
+- Observable outcome and acceptance criteria:
+- Authorized scope, exclusions and user-required next-step stop:
+- Highest risk R0–R3 and reason; unresolved questions:
+- Source revision/scoped hashes, environment/date, dirty files/preimages and ownership:
+- Existing working behavior to preserve; baseline evidence/source; preexisting failures and missing/unrun checks:
+
+| Entry/caller and dependency | Changed surface/contract/state | Consumers and adjacent behavior to preserve | Evidence or exclusion reason |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| | | | |
