+
+| Impact or preserved behavior | Check/command or manual action | Expected result | Environment/evidence type | Baseline/coverage gap |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| | | | | |
+
+- Applicable baseline gates selected from current scripts/config; reason for bounded regression selection:
+- Implementer/files; independent QC when required; final verifier/root:
+- Stop conditions, rollback/disable/forward-recovery path and limits:
+- External effects/target/caps/cost and existing approval, or evidence of local/read-only scope:
+- Intake reviewed by coordinator/owner of task; implementation ready or BLOCKED with reason:
+
+Record scope/risk changes before implementing them. Existing authorization persists; this form neither adds an approval gate nor bypasses an existing one.

