+# MCY final QC — <task ID>
+
+Use [TASK_LIFECYCLE.md](TASK_LIFECYCLE.md). This unfilled template is BLOCKED; it is neither test evidence nor approval.
+
+- Intake/acceptance criteria and authorized step:
+- Candidate freeze path/hash or immutable revision; changed files, dependent inputs, tests/config and artifacts:
+- Implementer; reviewer and independence/expertise; final verifier/root:
+- Diff/impact review: changed behavior, preserved adjacent working features and scope exclusions:
+
+| Acceptance/impact/regression | Exact command or manual action | Source/environment/evidence type | Exit code and result | Evidence path/limitations |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| | | | | |
+
+Use PASS/FAIL/BLOCKED/NOT_APPLICABLE; explain NOT_APPLICABLE. Record failures, interruptions, missing coverage and supplemental runs separately. Identify fixture/local/simulator/physical/live/user-reported evidence. Do not claim a whole suite PASS from selected case output or claim live behavior from fixtures.
+
+- Independent findings with severity, evidence and disposition; scope of reviewer reruns versus implementer evidence:
+- Changes after review; new freeze and affected rechecks, or compared inputs justifying evidence reuse:
+- Final source/artifact pins match; preexisting work preserved; links/claims checked:
+- Final verifier/root direct checks and result (do not infer from implementer report):
+- Remaining acceptance gaps, residual risks, rollback/disable path and limits:
+- Handoff status and next authorized action; explicit user review boundary before next step:
+
+Required independent QC or final verification still pending means BLOCKED for that handoff. A completed local task does not clear separate native, live or release gates, and does not guarantee zero regression.

